  "title": "Three Cheese Baked Pasta",
  "description": "Mozzarella, provolone and Parmesan cheeses are layered with cooked pasta, tart sour cream and tomato sauce flavored with onions and ground meat to make a deliciously hearty casserole.",
  "authors": [
    "Lorna"
  ],
